WEBVTT

00:17:56.121 --> 00:18:00.246
the movie going audience that mainly
watches things like superhero movies

00:18:00.246 --> 00:18:03.913
or big franchise films. Do you not
believe that that's a problem?

00:18:04.079 --> 00:18:05.996
I think people should watch
what they like.

00:18:06.788 --> 00:18:09.121
And if that's superhero movies,
it's all good. Right?

00:18:09.121 --> 00:18:11.121
There are a lot of really good
superhero movies out there.

00:18:11.121 --> 00:18:16.038
Black Panther, excellent film. Thor
Ragnarok, excellent film. Right.

00:18:16.288 --> 00:18:19.996
Thor Ragnarok is a meditation
on refugees and

00:18:19.996 --> 00:18:22.621
the displacement of peoples Black Panther.

00:18:22.829 --> 00:18:25.163
There's a reason why Immigrant Song
is the song they play over

00:18:25.163 --> 00:18:26.288
the climactic battle scene.

00:18:26.579 --> 00:18:29.329
Black Panther is about many things,

00:18:29.329 --> 00:18:32.413
but it is fundamentally about this
tension between, you know,